    echo "root: <repo> stands for the repository's top level (inside <home>, so scrubbed first); scripts/counting.sh, the spec, the named_style test module, the previous phase's test.log, M6 part 4 P3's API record, styles.rs, styles/elements.rs and package.rs at M6 part 4 P3's phase commit, the diffs of the three commits ruling AY names, and crates/emend/src at the phase commit, are read from it by git show, git diff or git archive, the working spec is hashed in it, cargo test, clippy and doc run in it with their output in <target>/main, the listing program reads its history, and the API record is installed in its records unless TEST_RECORDS_DEST names another (changes UX, VJ, VK, WS, WY, XE, XV, YF and YP)"
    echo "root: <home> stands for the home directory of the account that ran this script"
